            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "schemas/firmware.json",
                    "line": 174,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "'CPLD' is used everywhere else"
                },
                {
                    "file": "schemas/firmware.json",
                    "line": 174,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "How does this surface on dbus?  If we are making a new configuration object as a result of this (which I'd expect based on the fact that there is a new property UpdateGpio), I think we need a phosphor-dbus-interfaces addition for this new Configuration interface?\n\ncc: @paligill@gmail.com"
                },
                {
                    "file": "schemas/firmware.json",
                    "line": 174,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alex-TS-Wang",
                        "email": "alex.ts.wang@fii-foxconn.com",
                        "username": "Alex-TS-Wang"
                    },
                    "message": "Done.\n\nI have submitted the interface definition to phosphor-dbus-interfaces: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/89727\n\nRegarding your question on how this surfaces on D-Bus:\n\n1. Entity-Manager will be responsible for instantiating this configuration object (e.g., under /xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/...) based on the machine-specific JSON configuration.\n\n2. This service (phosphor-software-manager) now uses the auto-generated async client proxy to discover and consume this interface, replacing the manual property fetching."
                },
                {
                    "file": "schemas/firmware.json",
                    "line": 174,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alex-TS-Wang",
                        "email": "alex.ts.wang@fii-foxconn.com",
                        "username": "Alex-TS-Wang"
                    },
                    "message": "Done."
                }
