                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you give an example dbus introspect of the new object (or property) that this creates?  I think I'm fine with it from an EM perspective but I'm not convinced the dbus interface you created is complete / correct."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 23,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alex-TS-Wang",
                        "email": "alex.ts.wang@fii-foxconn.com",
                        "username": "Alex-TS-Wang"
                    },
                    "message": "Here is an example introspect output for the created object:\n\nThis patch creates the following D-Bus object:\n\n/xyz/openbmc_project/inventory/system/board/Clemente_SCM/Clemente_SCM_CPLD\n\nExample introspect output:\n\nxyz.openbmc_project.Configuration.AlteraMAX10_10M16Firmware\n.Address      property  t  49\n.Bus          property  t  7\n.Name         property  s  \"Clemente_SCM_CPLD\"\n.Type         property  s  \"AlteraMAX10_10M16Firmware\"\n.UpdateGpio   property  s  \"USBDBG_IPMI_EN_L\"\n\nxyz.openbmc_project.Configuration.AlteraMAX10_10M16Firmware.FirmwareInfo\n.CompatibleHardware  property  s  \"com.meta.Hardware.Clemente.CPLD.MAX10_10M16\"\n.VendorIANA          property  t  40981"
                },
                {
                    "file": "schemas/cpld.json",
                    "line": 36,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "You'll still need a PDI commit to add this new property."
                },
                {
                    "file": "schemas/cpld.json",
                    "line": 36,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alex-TS-Wang",
                        "email": "alex.ts.wang@fii-foxconn.com",
                        "username": "Alex-TS-Wang"
                    },
                    "message": "I have already added the corresponding PDI commit for this new property\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/90209"
                },
                {
                    "file": "schemas/cpld.json",
                    "line": 38,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "There is already MuxOutputs for this purpose which also allows you to specify the required polarity as well. Please use it."
                },
                {
                    "file": "schemas/cpld.json",
                    "line": 38,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alex-TS-Wang",
                        "email": "alex.ts.wang@fii-foxconn.com",
                        "username": "Alex-TS-Wang"
                    },
                    "message": "I will switch to the existing MuxOutputs interface for this use case and remove the newly added property(UpdateGpio)\nDoes this look OK?"
                }
            ],
